31667.d:
Wefts is a poetic, digital exploration that weaves the imaginary through the prism of code and textile art. This generative project echoes craft traditions while unfolding in a universe where each line of code is transformed into a thread of emotion.

///\\\///\\\///

The top 10 collectors will receive free access to a special series of Wefts, limited to 10 pieces, to be released on April 30, 2025.

///\\\///\\\///

